!Name: var-exp3
!C A c/2 period tripling convoy.
!C This convoy can period triple any rake which has a period which is
!C a multiple of 16 starting with 64.  Shown here is three copies of the
!C period tripling convoy applied to a base period 80 rake, producing a
!C period 2160 rake.
!C David I. Bell, June 2002
!Source: jslife-moving
